      "message": "fix(post): make TinyG tool changes and motion output safe\n\nStop outputs explicitly before manual tool changes, restore modal state\nand Z clearance after M0, and seat the first cut at its safe start.\nRefuse rounded-zero feeds and ambiguous tiny arcs, split XY full turns,\nand bound non-XY chord output for older-controller compatibility.\nAdd optional spindle dwell, name smoothing requests, and include the\nrecorded TinyG post suite and updated regression evidence.\n\nRefs #836\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>",
